sequenceDiagram
    participant Author
    participant Gate as the hook or CI
    participant Scan as tools/claims.py
    participant Source as the source tree
    participant Lists as the two lists

    Author->>Gate: commit, or open a pull request
    Gate->>Scan: run the scan
    Scan->>Source: tokenize every module outside the tests
    Source-->>Scan: every bold run, with its line and symbol
    Scan->>Lists: every entry and every owed line
    Lists-->>Scan: the claims they account for, by whole text
    opt on a pull request
        Scan->>Lists: the owed list at the base
        Lists-->>Scan: did the seeded ticket grow?
        Scan-->>Gate: claims that lost their bold, as a warning
    end
    alt every claim accounted for, nothing stale, the seed did not grow
        Scan-->>Gate: pass, and the owed count
    else anything else
        Scan-->>Gate: fail, grouped by file, with three ways out
        Gate-->>Author: list it, owe it, or remove the bold
    end
